  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Wiring contract",
      "items": [
        "App calls start() / setAgentSpeaking(); the facade emits onSpeechStart, onTurnEnd, onInterrupt (speak-or-no-speak.js:69-116)",
        "Each engine opens its own getUserMedia stream with AEC constraints; vad-web's own segmentation stays unwired (silero-vad-adapter.js:224-251)",
        "vad-web resolves dual-mode: window.vad CDN → import('@ricky0123/vad-web') → cdn-unavailable (silero-vad-adapter.js:199-215)",
        "The demo wires SmartTurnModel behind a checkbox and passes it via options (demo/main.js:78-81)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Degradation ladder",
      "items": [
        "Silero load failure → EnergyVad fallback re-opens the mic; degraded.engine = \"energy\" + engine-fallback warning (speak-or-no-speak.js:75-95)",
        "Mic track without active AEC → stricter barge-in gating: ~300 ms confirm + rms > 2× rolling playback baseline (turn-detector.js:196-201)",
        "Smart-turn model error or 300 ms timeout → fail-open: the turn end emits anyway (turn-detector.js:467-474)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Real-time discipline",
      "items": [
        "STT lives outside the real-time loop — the module never calls adapters; apps wire them to onTurnEnd audio only (stt-adapter.js:4-13)",
        "While the agent flag is armed, no turn ends — confirmed speech fires onInterrupt instead (turn-detector.js:187-236)",
        "npm start serves the zero-build page, ES modules and /vendor/*.onnx via python3 http.server :5173 (package.json:22)"
      ]
    }
  ]
